cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pre-check-research (pcr), please cite it as research software."
title: "pre-check-research: Pre-submission research data risk audit toolkit"
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-05-23"
type: software
license: MIT
authors:
  - name: "PreCheckResearch contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/PreCheckResearch/pre-check-research"
url: "https://github.com/PreCheckResearch/pre-check-research"
abstract: >-
  pre-check-research (pcr) is a local-first CLI toolkit for pre-submission
  research data audit workflows, including reproducibility checks, statistical
  consistency screening, manuscript/material review, provenance checks, and
  explainable risk-signal reporting.
keywords:
  - research integrity
  - reproducibility
  - data audit
  - statistical consistency
  - manuscript screening
  - open science
  - forensic statistics
